    </p>
    <p class="home-about-text">
      Years of QA work on large productions built a habit of asking why a problem exists, not just fixing it, and building processes so it doesn't recur.
    </p>
    <p class="mono"><a class="text-link" href="/about/">More about Jovian &rarr;</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
